<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>In the universe His shining</l><l>Produced the old creation,</l><l>His new creation’s made by</l><l>Shining in our hearts.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>God’s shining results in</l><l>The illumination,</l><l>Knowing God’s glory</l><l>In the face of Christ.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>This enlightenment that</l><l>Does make known the glory</l><l>Issues from the shining</l><l>Of God in our hearts.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
